    "A dónde va tu ingreso fijo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where your fixed income goes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A este ritmo no te alcanza el mes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At this pace, the month won’t be enough"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A qué te dedicas (ej. dueño de un negocio, empleado...)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you do (e.g., business owner, employee...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A veces iOS no ejecuta la automatización con todas las notificaciones. Si falta un movimiento, anótalo a mano.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sometimes iOS doesn't run the automation for every notification. If a transaction is missing, log it by hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abona extra a %@ primero: es tu deuda más cara (%@%% al mes).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay extra toward %@ first: it’s your most expensive debt (%@%% a month)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abonar a la meta": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to goal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi con la cámara lista para escanear el QR de tu factura y ganar cashback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens MonAvi with the camera ready to scan your receipt's QR code and earn cashback."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi con la cámara lista para tu factura.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens MonAvi with the camera ready for your receipt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi e inicia sesión primero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open MonAvi and sign in first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi escuchando: di un gasto o un ingreso (por ejemplo «gasté 12 dólares en almuerzo» o «me pagaron 500 de salario») y MonAvi lo anota solo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens MonAvi listening: say an expense or income (for example “I spent 12 dollars on lunch” or “I got paid 500 in salary”) and MonAvi logs it for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi listo para anotar un gasto o un ingreso.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens MonAvi ready to log an expense or income."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi listo para anotar un gasto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens MonAvi ready to log an expense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi para cambiar cuándo estará disponible tu dinero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open MonAvi to change when your money will be available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi para registrar %@. Revisa tu conexión a internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open MonAvi to log %@. Check your internet connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abre MonAvi para registrar este movimiento. Revisa tu conexión a internet.": {
