          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send suggestion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es dinero tuyo que cambia de cuenta: no cuenta como gasto ni como ingreso.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's your own money moving between accounts: it doesn't count as an expense or income."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es menos que el ingreso fijo que nos dijiste (%@). ¿Te falta anotar algún ingreso?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That’s less than the fixed income you told us about (%@). Are you missing some income to log?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es menos que el mínimo: puede generar recargos e intereses de mora.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's less than the minimum: it may lead to late fees and penalty interest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es más de lo que tiene %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's more than %@ has."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Es opcional: deja vacío lo que no quieras limitar. Toca un nombre para cambiarlo o desliza para quitarlo. Puedes agregar o cambiar presupuestos cuando quieras en la pestaña Presupuestos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is optional: leave blank anything you don't want to limit. Tap a name to change it or swipe to remove it. You can add or change budgets anytime in the Budgets tab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esa contraseña es muy común o apareció en filtraciones de otros sitios. Elige otra (por ejemplo, una frase con números).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That password is very common or has appeared in leaks from other sites. Choose another (for example, a phrase with numbers)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanea el QR de una factura electrónica y la registramos como gasto de una vez. Ganas 1%% de cashback de cada factura verificada.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan the QR code on an e-invoice and we'll log it as an expense right away. You earn 1%% cashback on every verified receipt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanea tu factura para ganar tu cashback y el bono por pagar con tarjeta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan your receipt to earn your cashback and the bonus for paying by card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanea una factura que se verifique.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan a receipt that gets verified."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanear ahora": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanear con la cámara": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan with camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanear factura": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan receipt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanear mi factura": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan my receipt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escanéala y gana cashback. Se une a este gasto, no se anota dos veces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan it and earn cashback. It merges with this expense, so it isn't logged twice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribe ELIMINAR para confirmar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type DELETE to confirm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribe el código de 6 dígitos de tu app de autenticación.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribe el código de quien te invitó y gana %@ de cashback. Solo puedes usar un código, en tus primeros 7 días.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the code from whoever invited you and earn %@ in cashback. You can only use one code, within your first 7 days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribe solo el número, por ejemplo 52.30. Abre MonAvi para registrar %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type just the number, for example 52.30. Open MonAvi to log %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribe un correo valido.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a valid email."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escribenos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact us"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese código es de ambiente de pruebas, no de una factura real.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That code is from a test environment, not a real receipt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese código no es de una factura electrónica.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That code isn’t from an electronic receipt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese día te preguntamos si ya está disponible y te ayudamos a pasarlo a otra cuenta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That day we'll ask if it's available and help you move it to another account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese día te volvemos a preguntar si ya está disponible el dinero de %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That day we'll ask again if the money from %@ is available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese día te volvemos a preguntar si ya está disponible el dinero de %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That day we'll ask again if the money from %lld is available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esta cuenta no tiene ese dinero": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This account doesn't have that much money"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esta factura es de un mes anterior — solo se pueden registrar facturas del mes en curso (o del mes pasado durante los primeros %@ días del mes).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This receipt is from a previous month — you can only log receipts from the current month (or from last month during the first %@ days of the month)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esta factura es del mes pasado: se registra el gasto en su fecha, pero ya no gana cashback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This receipt is from last month: the expense is logged on its date, but it no longer earns cashback."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esta factura tiene fecha futura — revisa que sea el código correcto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This receipt has a future date — make sure it’s the right code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esta factura ya fue registrada (por ti o por otra cuenta).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This receipt has already been logged (by you or by another account)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
