    "Pon tu dinero a trabajar": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put your money to work"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pon un límite por categoría (comida, súper…) y mira aquí cuánto te queda.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set a limit per category (food, groceries…) and see here how much you have left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponle el nombre que quieras, ej. \"Ahorro viaje\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name it whatever you like, e.g. “Trip savings”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponle un límite al mes a lo que más gastas. En Hoy verás cuánto llevas en cada uno, justo debajo del total del día.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set a monthly limit on what you spend the most on. On Today you'll see how much you've spent in each one, right below the day's total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponle un límite semanal o mensual a una categoría para no pasarte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set a weekly or monthly limit on a category so you don't overspend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponte al día con %@ antes que nada: la mora sube los intereses y daña tu historial.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catch up on %@ first: late payments raise your interest and hurt your history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponte al día con %@. La mora suma intereses y recargos, y afecta tu historial de crédito.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catch up on %@. Late payments add interest and fees, and hurt your credit history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ponte al día con %@: está en mora y eso sube los intereses y daña tu historial.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catch up on %@: it's past due, which raises your interest and hurts your history."
